Output docs/walkthroughs/suggestions.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1200
Set Height 720
Set TypingSpeed 60ms

Type "echo 'In Changes view: stage files first'"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "echo 'Press 1-3 to apply a ranked suggestion'"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "echo 'Edit commit message manually, then press Enter to commit'"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "echo 'Tune settings.suggestions.* in Settings if needed'"
Enter
Sleep 1s
